{% comment %}
  Belle's Performance Tennis - Customer Reviews

  Real Google reviews, rendered as plain server HTML so crawlers and AI
  answers can read them. This exists because the homepage previously had
  zero proof of a completed job in its source: no review text, no rating,
  nothing. Judge.me was removed from this theme deliberately, so this is
  not a replacement widget, it is static text under the owner's control.

  HARD RULES, do not relax these:

  1. Quotes are VERBATIM. Do not fix spelling, punctuation or emoji in a
     customer's words. If a quote needs trimming, cut whole sentences and
     leave the rest untouched. Never paraphrase a review.
  2. Never invent a review, a name, or an attribution. An earlier
     third-party audit suggested adding a made-up testimonial credited to
     a "Local League Player". That is a fake review and it is not going on
     this site.
  3. NO AggregateRating or Review structured data here, on purpose.
     Google does not allow a business to mark up reviews about itself that
     it collected or copied from a third-party site. These came from the
     Google Business Profile, so marking them up would breach the
     structured data policy and risks a manual action. Displaying them as
     visible text is fine. Marking them up is not.

  Source: Google Business Profile for Belle's Performance Tennis Shop.
  Pulled 2026-09-07.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  .bre {
    --bre-green: #1a3c2a;
    --bre-gold: #c8a951;
    --bre-border: #e5e5e5;
    --bre-text: #1a1a1a;
    --bre-muted: #666;
    --bre-bg: #faf9f6;
    --bre-white: #ffffff;
    font-family: 'Source Sans Pro', 'Source Sans Pro Fallback', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bre-bg);
    padding: 44px 20px;
  }

  .bre-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .bre-head {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 26px;
  }

  .bre-eyebrow {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--bre-gold);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .bre-head h2 {
    font-family: 'Bebas Neue', 'Bebas Neue Fallback', sans-serif;
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    color: var(--bre-green);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .bre-sub {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--bre-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /*
    Carousel with NO JavaScript.

    CSS scroll-snap, not a slider library. This page already carries a
    documented mobile LCP problem (11-12.5s) and a history of fighting
    render-blocking weight, so adding a slider script to it would be
    working against the performance notes in CLAUDE.md. Scroll-snap gives
    swipe-and-snap on touch, drag and keyboard on desktop, and costs
    nothing at runtime.

    Every review stays in the server HTML. That is the whole point of this
    section: crawlers and AI answers read the markup, not a JS-built DOM.
    Do not swap this for a library that renders slides client side.
  */
  .bre-grid {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    scroll-padding-left: 2px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: thin;
  }

  .bre-grid::-webkit-scrollbar {
    height: 6px;
  }

  .bre-grid::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: rgba(26, 60, 42, 0.25);
    border-radius: 3px;
  }

  .bre-grid:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--bre-gold);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .bre-card {
    background: var(--bre-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--bre-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 20px 22px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    flex: 0 0 clamp(250px, 31%, 300px);
  }

  /* Decorative only. Deliberately not marked up as structured data,
     see the note at the top of this file. */
  .bre-stars {
    color: var(--bre-gold);
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .bre-quote {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--bre-text);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .bre-attr {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--bre-muted);
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: 12px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--bre-border);
  }

  .bre-attr strong {
    color: var(--bre-green);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .bre-foot {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .bre-foot a {
    color: var(--bre-green);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  @media (max-width: 749px) {
    .bre {
      padding: 32px 16px;
    }

    .bre-card {
      flex-basis: 84%;
    }

    .bre-head h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }
  }
</style>

<div class="bre">
  <div class="bre-container">

    <div class="bre-head">
      {% if section.settings.eyebrow != blank %}
        <p class="bre-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% if section.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h2>{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
      {% if section.settings.subheading != blank %}
        <p class="bre-sub">{{ section.settings.subheading }}</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="bre-grid" role="region" aria-label="Customer reviews, scrollable" tabindex="0">
      {% for block in section.blocks %}
        <div class="bre-card" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          {% if block.settings.show_stars %}
            <div class="bre-stars" aria-label="Five out of five stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
          {% endif %}
          <blockquote class="bre-quote">{{ block.settings.quote }}</blockquote>
          <p class="bre-attr">
            <strong>{{ block.settings.name }}</strong>{% if block.settings.detail != blank %}, {{ block.settings.detail }}{% endif %}
          </p>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    {% if section.settings.footer_text != blank and section.settings.footer_url != blank %}
      <p class="bre-foot">
        <a href="{{ section.settings.footer_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ section.settings.footer_text }}</a>
      </p>
    {% endif %}

  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Customer Reviews",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "belle-reviews-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "eyebrow",
      "label": "Eyebrow",
      "default": "Reviews"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "What customers say"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "subheading",
      "label": "Subheading",
      "default": "Quoted from Google, word for word."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "footer_text",
      "label": "Footer link text",
      "default": "Read the reviews on Google"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "footer_url",
      "label": "Footer link URL"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "review",
      "name": "Review",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "quote",
          "label": "Review text",
          "info": "Paste the review exactly as written. Do not correct spelling or punctuation."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "name",
          "label": "Reviewer name"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "detail",
          "label": "Detail",
          "info": "Shown after the name, for example: Google review, August 2026"
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "show_stars",
          "label": "Show five stars",
          "default": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 20,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Customer Reviews",
      "blocks": [{ "type": "review" }, { "type": "review" }, { "type": "review" }]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
